==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|humidite|}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|humiditas}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|umidus||damp, moist, wet}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/hjuːˈmɪdɪti/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|humidities}}

# [[dampness|Dampness]], especially that of the [[air]].
# The [[amount]] of [[water]] [[vapour]] in the air.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|absolute humidity}}
* {{l|en|relative humidity}}
* {{l|en|specific humidity}}

====Related terms====
